<title>USA: TWA completes $50 million private offering.</title>
<headline>TWA completes $50 million private offering.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trans World Airlines Inc said Monday it completed a private placement of about $50 million in 12 percent senior secured notes due 2002, including a redeemable warrant to buy 126.26 shares of TWA common stock.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the offering will be used for general corporate purposes, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
